<title>USA: Palm Beach County, Fla., yields 5.7 pct in 2016.</title>
<headline>Palm Beach County, Fla., yields 5.7 pct in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes Inc said Monday it tentatively priced $26.3 million Palm Beach County, Fla., parks bonds at a top yield of 5.7 percent in 2016.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
